1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
Khalid kata, tak ada apa-apa.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,190
Apa kata Nabi SAW?

3
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:08,310
Fa innaka lam tahdimha, farji'

4
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:10,060
ilaiha fahdimha.

5
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,560
Sesungguhnya kamu belum lagi

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,760
memusnahkannya.

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:17,980
Kembali semula ke sana dan memusnahkannya.

8
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:22,230
Nabi tahu, al-Uzza ni bukan biasa-biasa

9
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,080
berhala ni.

10
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,680
Banyak dia punya penunggu-penunggu ni.

11
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:31,380
Barangkali Khalid sekadar merobohkannya,

12
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,320
menumbangkan

13
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:34,660
dia.

14
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:38,390
Bila Nabi kata, kamu masa pergi

15
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:41,560
tadi, kamu ada nampak apa-apa?

16
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,490
Tak ada.

17
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,990
Baik, pergi balik.

18
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:46,920
Kamu belum memusnahkannya lagi.

19
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,400
Kalau kamu memusnahkannya, pasti

20
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,400
kamu akan nampak sesuatu.

21
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:55,040
Jadi, Khalid pergi balik dengan

22
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,390
marah dan menghunus pedang.

23
00:00:57,390 --> 00:01:00,060
Apabila tiba di tempat berhala itu,

24
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:02,140
tiba-tiba menjelma seorang perempuan

25
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:04,160
hitam yang bertelanjang dengan

26
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:06,850
rambut yang mengerbang dan

27
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:10,390
penjaga berhala bertempik.

28
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,670
Ya Uzza, 'awwiriha!

29
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:16,820
Ya Uzza, khabbiliha!

30
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:21,050
Ya Uzza, butakan dia.

31
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:23,280
Musnahkan dia.

32
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:27,010
Ya Uzza, musnahkan dia, butakan dia.

33
00:01:27,010 --> 00:01:30,370
Maksudnya, perempuan tadi itu adalah

34
00:01:30,370 --> 00:01:32,720
jelmaan bagi Uzza.

35
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,810
Jin yang dinampakkan.

36
00:01:35,010 --> 00:01:37,170
Lalu, Khalid dengan pantas

37
00:01:37,170 --> 00:01:40,120
menetaknya sehingga putus dua.

38
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,220
Kemudian, beliau kembali menghadap

39
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:44,800
Rasulullah SAW dan baginda bersabda,

40
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:47,280
na'am, tilkal Uzza.
